{"headword":"עַתָּ֫ה","parent_lexicon":"BDB Dictionary","content":{"senses":[{"definition":"(also <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 23:43\" href=\"/Ezekiel.23.43\">Ez 23:43</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 74:6\" href=\"/Psalms.74.6\">ψ 74:6</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">עת</span> Kt, Qr <span dir=\"rtl\">עַתָּה</span>), <span dir=\"rtl\">עָ֑֫תָּה</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 32:5\" href=\"/Genesis.32.5\">Gn 32:5</a> +, <strong>adv.</strong> of time, <strong>now (</strong>proposes acc. of [<em>’int</em>], <span dir=\"rtl\">עֵת</span> (Kö<sup>ii. 260</sup>), <em>at the time</em>, in partic. of the present time, i.e. <em>now;</em> cf. Germ. <em>zur Zeit</em>, Arabic <span dir=\"rtl\">اَلْآنَ</span> <em>at the time</em>, i.e. <em>now</em><strong>)</strong>;—<em>now:</em>"},{"senses":[{"senses":[{"definition":"<a data-ref=\"Genesis 12:19\" href=\"/Genesis.12.19\">Gn 12:19</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">ועתה הנה אשׁתך</span> and <em>now</em>, behold thy wife, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 22:12\" href=\"/Genesis.22.12\">22:12</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">כי עתה ידעתי</span> <em>now</em> I know (so <a data-ref=\"Exodus 18:11\" href=\"/Exodus.18.11\">Ex 18:11</a>; <a data-ref=\"Judges 17:13\" href=\"/Judges.17.13\">Ju 17:13</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Kings 17:24\" href=\"/I_Kings.17.24\">1 K 17:24</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">[עַתָּה זֶה]</span>, <a data-ref=\"Psalms 20:7\" href=\"/Psalms.20.7\">ψ 20:7</a>), <a data-ref=\"Genesis 26:22\" href=\"/Genesis.26.22\">26:22</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 26:29\" href=\"/Genesis.26.29\">29</a>; <a data-ref=\"Genesis 27:36\" href=\"/Genesis.27.36\">27:36</a>; <a data-ref=\"Genesis 31:13\" href=\"/Genesis.31.13\">31:13</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 31:28\" href=\"/Genesis.31.28\">28</a>, etc., <a data-ref=\"Exodus 5:5\" href=\"/Exodus.5.5\">Ex 5:5</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">הן רבים עתה עם הארץ</span>; whether in opp. to past time, as <a data-ref=\"Genesis 32:11\" href=\"/Genesis.32.11\">Gn 32:11</a>; <a data-ref=\"Joshua 14:11\" href=\"/Joshua.14.11\">Jos 14:11</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">כְּכֹחִי אָז וּכְכֹחִי עָ֑תָּה</span>, <a data-ref=\"Judges 11:8\" href=\"/Judges.11.8\">Ju 11:8</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Kings 12:4\" href=\"/I_Kings.12.4\">1 K 12:4</a>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 1:21\" href=\"/Isaiah.1.21\">Is 1:21</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">ועתה מרצהים</span>, <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 16:14\" href=\"/Isaiah.16.14\">16:14</a> <a data-ref=\"Hosea 2:9\" href=\"/Hosea.2.9\">Ho 2:9</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">כִּי טוֹב לִי אָז מֵעָ֑תָּה</span>, <a data-ref=\"Hosea 13:2\" href=\"/Hosea.13.2\">13:2</a>; <a data-ref=\"Job 30:1\" href=\"/Job.30.1\">Jb 30:1</a> +, or to future, as <a data-ref=\"Numbers 24:17\" href=\"/Numbers.24.17\">Nu 24:17</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">אֶרְאֶנּוּ ולא עתה</span>, <a data-ref=\"Judges 8:6\" href=\"/Judges.8.6\">Ju 8:6</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">הֲכַף זֶבַח וצ׳ עַתָּה־בְּיָדֶ֑ךָ</span>, <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 2:16\" href=\"/I_Samuel.2.16\">1 S 2:16</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">כִּי עַתָּה תִּתֵּן</span>; = <em>after all</em> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 22:38\" href=\"/Numbers.22.38\">Nu 22:38</a>; <a data-ref=\"Judges 8:2\" href=\"/Judges.8.2\">Ju 8:2</a>; = <em>now at last</em> <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 24:16\" href=\"/II_Samuel.24.16\">2 S 24:16</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Kings 19:4\" href=\"/I_Kings.19.4\">1 K 19:4</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Kings 19:25\" href=\"/II_Kings.19.25\">2 K 19:25</a>; <a data-ref=\"Hosea 7:2\" href=\"/Hosea.7.2\">Ho 7:2</a>; <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 4:12\" href=\"/Jeremiah.4.12\">Je 4:12</a>; and in the phr. <span dir=\"rtl\">מעתה ועד עולם</span> †<a data-ref=\"Isaiah 9:6\" href=\"/Isaiah.9.6\">Is 9:6</a>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 59:21\" href=\"/Isaiah.59.21\">59:21</a>; <a data-ref=\"Micah 4:7\" href=\"/Micah.4.7\">Mi 4:7</a> (v. infr.), <a data-ref=\"Psalms 113:2\" href=\"/Psalms.113.2\">ψ 113:2</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 115:18\" href=\"/Psalms.115.18\">115:18</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 121:8\" href=\"/Psalms.121.8\">121:8</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 125:2\" href=\"/Psalms.125.2\">125:2</a>; <a data-ref=\"Psalms 131:3\" href=\"/Psalms.131.3\">131:3</a>."}],"num":"a."},{"senses":[{"definition":"of the imminent or impending future: <a data-ref=\"Genesis 19:9\" href=\"/Genesis.19.9\">Gn 19:9</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">עַתָּה נָרַע לְךָ מֵהֶם</span>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 29:32\" href=\"/Genesis.29.32\">29:32</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">כי עתה יאהבני אישׁי</span>, v <a data-ref=\"Genesis 29:34\" href=\"/Genesis.29.34\">34</a> <a data-ref=\"Exodus 6:1\" href=\"/Exodus.6.1\">Ex 6:1</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">עתה תראה</span>, <a data-ref=\"Numbers 11:23\" href=\"/Numbers.11.23\">Nu 11:23</a>; <a data-ref=\"Numbers 22:4\" href=\"/Numbers.22.4\">22:4</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 20:6\" href=\"/II_Samuel.20.6\">2 S 20:6</a>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 33:10\" href=\"/Isaiah.33.10\">Is 33:10</a> (<a data-ref=\"Psalms 12:6\" href=\"/Psalms.12.6\">ψ 12:6</a>), <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 43:19\" href=\"/Isaiah.43.19\">43:19</a>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 49:19\" href=\"/Isaiah.49.19\">49:19</a>; <a data-ref=\"Amos 6:7\" href=\"/Amos.6.7\">Am 6:7</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">לכן עתה יִגְלוּ</span>, <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 49:19\" href=\"/Isaiah.49.19\">Is 49:19</a>; <a data-ref=\"Micah 7:4\" href=\"/Micah.7.4\">Mi 7:4</a>, <a data-ref=\"Micah 7:10\" href=\"/Micah.7.10\">10</a>; <a data-ref=\"Daniel 10:20\" href=\"/Daniel.10.20\">Dn 10:20</a>; and especially ἀσυνδέτως in Hos, introducing a punishment, <a data-ref=\"Hosea 4:16\" href=\"/Hosea.4.16\">Ho 4:16</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">עתה יִרְעֵם י׳ וגו׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Hosea 5:7\" href=\"/Hosea.5.7\">5:7</a>; <a data-ref=\"Hosea 8:8\" href=\"/Hosea.8.8\">8:8</a>, <a data-ref=\"Hosea 8:13\" href=\"/Hosea.8.13\">13</a> (<a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 14:10\" href=\"/Jeremiah.14.10\">Je 14:10</a>), <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 10:2\" href=\"/Jeremiah.10.2\">10:2</a>."}],"num":"b."},{"senses":[{"definition":"of a time <em>ideally</em> present (= <em>then</em>, from our point of view): <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 29:22\" href=\"/Isaiah.29.22\">Is 29:22</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">לא עתה יבושׁ יעקב</span>, v b <a data-ref=\"Hosea 10:3\" href=\"/Hosea.10.3\">Ho 10:3</a>; <a data-ref=\"Micah 4:9\" href=\"/Micah.4.9\">Mi 4:9</a>, <a data-ref=\"Micah 4:10\" href=\"/Micah.4.10\">10</a>, <a data-ref=\"Micah 4:11\" href=\"/Micah.4.11\">11</a>, <a data-ref=\"Micah 4:14\" href=\"/Micah.4.14\">14</a>; <a data-ref=\"Micah 5:3\" href=\"/Micah.5.3\">5:3</a>."}],"num":"c."},{"senses":[{"definition":"describing a present state = <em>as things are:</em> <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 8:5\" href=\"/I_Samuel.8.5\">1 S 8:5</a> thou art old, etc., <span dir=\"rtl\">עתה שִׂימָה לנו מלך</span>, <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 9:6\" href=\"/I_Samuel.9.6\">9:6</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 13:12\" href=\"/I_Samuel.13.12\">13:12</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 14:30\" href=\"/I_Samuel.14.30\">14:30</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 25:7\" href=\"/I_Samuel.25.7\">25:7b</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 27:1\" href=\"/I_Samuel.27.1\">27:1</a> <em>now</em> I shall be swept away one day, etc., <a data-ref=\"II Kings 18:20\" href=\"/II_Kings.18.20\">2 K 18:20</a>, <a data-ref=\"II Kings 18:25\" href=\"/II_Kings.18.25\">25</a>; <a data-ref=\"Job 6:21\" href=\"/Job.6.21\">Jb 6:21</a>; <a data-ref=\"Job 14:16\" href=\"/Job.14.16\">14:16</a>; <a data-ref=\"Job 16:7\" href=\"/Job.16.7\">16:7</a>."}],"num":"d."},{"senses":[{"definition":"with an Imv., as an encouragement, implying that the time has come for the exhortation or advice to be followed, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 31:13\" href=\"/Genesis.31.13\">Gn 31:13</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">עתה קום צא</span>, <a data-ref=\"Exodus 18:19\" href=\"/Exodus.18.19\">Ex 18:19</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">עתה שְׁמַע בקולי</span>, <a data-ref=\"Numbers 22:11\" href=\"/Numbers.22.11\">Nu 22:11</a> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 2:13\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.2.13\">Dt 2:13</a> <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 30:8\" href=\"/Isaiah.30.8\">Is 30:8</a>."}],"num":"e."}],"num":"1."},{"senses":[{"definition":"Phrases:"},{"senses":[{"definition":"<span dir=\"rtl\">עַתָּה זֶה</span> (<span dir=\"rtl\">זֶה</span> <strong>4 h</strong>) †<a data-ref=\"I Kings 17:24\" href=\"/I_Kings.17.24\">1 K 17:24</a> <a data-ref=\"II Kings 5:22\" href=\"/II_Kings.5.22\">2 K 5:22</a>."}],"num":"a."},{"senses":[{"definition":"<span dir=\"rtl\">ועתה</span> and, <em>now</em>, or <em>now</em>, therefore (<span dir=\"rtl\">וְ</span> <strong>4</strong>), drawing a conclusion, especially (cf. <strong>1 e</strong>) a practical one, from what has been stated: <a data-ref=\"Genesis 3:22\" href=\"/Genesis.3.22\">Gn 3:22</a> <em>and now</em> (since man has once been disobedinet), lest he put forth his hand, etc., <a data-ref=\"Genesis 20:7\" href=\"/Genesis.20.7\">20:7</a>; <a data-ref=\"Genesis 21:23\" href=\"/Genesis.21.23\">21:23</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">וְעַתָּה הִשָּֽׁבְעָה לִי הֵ֫נָּה</span>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 27:3\" href=\"/Genesis.27.3\">27:3</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 27:8\" href=\"/Genesis.27.8\">8</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">ועתה בני שְׁמַע בקולי</span>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 30:30\" href=\"/Genesis.30.30\">30:30</a>; <a data-ref=\"Genesis 31:16\" href=\"/Genesis.31.16\">31:16</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 31:44\" href=\"/Genesis.31.44\">44</a>; <a data-ref=\"Genesis 37:20\" href=\"/Genesis.37.20\">37:20</a> + often, <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 5:3\" href=\"/Isaiah.5.3\">Is 5:3</a>, <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 5:5\" href=\"/Isaiah.5.5\">5</a>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 36:8\" href=\"/Isaiah.36.8\">36:8</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 2:10\" href=\"/Psalms.2.10\">ψ 2:10</a>; <a data-ref=\"Genesis 11:6\" href=\"/Genesis.11.6\">Gn 11:6</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">ועתה לֹא־יִבָּצֵר מֵהֶם וגו׳</span>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 31:30\" href=\"/Genesis.31.30\">31:30</a>; <a data-ref=\"Genesis 45:8\" href=\"/Genesis.45.8\">45:8</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 19:11\" href=\"/II_Samuel.19.11\">2 S 19:11</a> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 39:8\" href=\"/Psalms.39.8\">ψ 39:8</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">ועתה מַה־קִּוִּיתִי אֲדֹנָי</span>, <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 52:5\" href=\"/Isaiah.52.5\">Is 52:5</a>."}],"num":"b."},{"senses":[{"definition":"<span dir=\"rtl\">וְעַתָּה הִנֵּה</span> stating the ground on which some conclusion or action is to be based, <a data-ref=\"Exodus 3:9\" href=\"/Exodus.3.9\">Ex 3:9</a> <a data-ref=\"Joshua 14:10\" href=\"/Joshua.14.10\">Jo 14:10</a><sup>(×2)</sup> <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 12:2\" href=\"/I_Samuel.12.2\">1 S 12:2</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 24:21\" href=\"/I_Samuel.24.21\">24:21</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Kings 1:18\" href=\"/I_Kings.1.18\">1 K 1:18</a>; <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 40:4\" href=\"/Jeremiah.40.4\">Je 40:4</a> (with <span dir=\"rtl\">ועתה</span> usually repeated after the <span dir=\"rtl\">הנה</span>-clause)."}],"num":"c."},{"senses":[{"definition":"<span dir=\"rtl\">גם עתה</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 44:10\" href=\"/Genesis.44.10\">Gn 44:10</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 12:16\" href=\"/I_Samuel.12.16\">1 S 12:16</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Kings 14:14\" href=\"/I_Kings.14.14\">1 K 14:14</a>; <a data-ref=\"Joel 2:12\" href=\"/Joel.2.12\">Jo 2:12</a>; <a data-ref=\"Job 16:19\" href=\"/Job.16.19\">Jb 16:19</a>."}],"all_cited":true,"num":"d."},{"senses":[{"definition":"<span dir=\"rtl\">מֵעַתָּה</span> <em>from now, henceforth</em>, <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 3:4\" href=\"/Jeremiah.3.4\">Je 3:4</a>; <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 48:6\" href=\"/Isaiah.48.6\">Is 48:6</a>; <a data-ref=\"Daniel 10:17\" href=\"/Daniel.10.17\">Dn 10:17</a> (according to some, here = from <em>just now</em>), <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 16:9\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.16.9\">2 Ch 16:9</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">מעתה ועד עולם</span>, v. supr. <strong>1 a</strong> <em>end</em>."}],"all_cited":true,"num":"e."},{"senses":[{"definition":"<span dir=\"rtl\">עַד־עַתָּה</span> <em>until now</em>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 32:5\" href=\"/Genesis.32.5\">Gn 32:5</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">וָאֵחַר עד־ע׳</span>, <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 12:9\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.12.9\">Dt 12:9</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">לא באתם עד ע׳ אל הנחלה</span> (opp. to the fut.), <a data-ref=\"II Kings 13:23\" href=\"/II_Kings.13.23\">2 K 13:23</a>; especially after clause with <span dir=\"rtl\">מִן</span>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 46:34\" href=\"/Genesis.46.34\">46:34</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">מִנְּעוּרֵינוּ וְעַד־ע׳</span> (<a data-ref=\"II Samuel 19:8\" href=\"/II_Samuel.19.8\">2 S 19:8</a> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 4:14\" href=\"/Ezekiel.4.14\">Ez 4:14</a>), <a data-ref=\"Exodus 9:18\" href=\"/Exodus.9.18\">Ex 9:18</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Kings 8:6\" href=\"/II_Kings.8.6\">2 K 8:6</a>; <a data-ref=\"Ruth 2:7\" href=\"/Ruth.2.7\">Ru 2:7</a>."}],"num":"f."},{"senses":[{"definition":"<span dir=\"rtl\">כִּי עַתָּה</span> <em>for in this case</em>, in our idiom, <em>for then</em> (<span dir=\"rtl\">עתה</span> pointing to a condition assumed as a possible contingency; cf. Dr<sup>§ 141, 142</sup>); †(<em>a</em>) <a data-ref=\"Exodus 9:15\" href=\"/Exodus.9.15\">Ex 9:15</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">כי עתה שׁלחתי וגו׳</span> for <em>then</em> (if the intention expressed in v <a data-ref=\"Exodus 9:14\" href=\"/Exodus.9.14\">14</a> had not existed) <em>I should have</em> put forth my hand, etc., <a data-ref=\"Numbers 22:29\" href=\"/Numbers.22.29\">Nu 22:29</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">כי עתה הֲרַגְתִּיךְ</span>, <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 13:13\" href=\"/I_Samuel.13.13\">1 S 13:13</a>; <a data-ref=\"Job 3:13\" href=\"/Job.3.13\">Jb 3:13</a>; sq. impf. <a data-ref=\"Job 6:3\" href=\"/Job.6.3\">Jb 6:3</a> for <em>then</em> (if it were weighed, v <a data-ref=\"Job 6:2\" href=\"/Job.6.2\">2</a>) it would be heavier, etc., <a data-ref=\"Job 13:19\" href=\"/Job.13.19\">13:19</a> <em>for then</em> would I be silent and die; (<em>b</em>) after a protasis, <em>surely then</em> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 31:42\" href=\"/Genesis.31.42\">Gn 31:42</a> + (see <a data-ref=\"BDB, כִּי²\" href=\"/BDB,_כִּי²\", dir=\"rtl\">כִּי</a> <strong>1 d</strong> <em>b</em>, p. 472).—"}],"num":"g."},{"definition":"Read <span dir=\"rtl\">כְּמוֹ עַתָּ</span> (𝔊 𝔙) <em>as now</em>, for <span dir=\"rtl\">כְּמוֹ עֵת</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 16:57\" href=\"/Ezekiel.16.57\">Ez 16:57</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">עַתָּ נִשְׁבַּרְתְּ</span> (𝔊 𝔖 𝔙) <em>now art thou broken!</em> for <span dir=\"rtl\">עֵת נִשְׁבֶּרֶת</span> <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 27:34\" href=\"/Ezekiel.27.34\">Ez 27:34</a>, and prob. <span dir=\"rtl\">עַתָּ בָּא</span> (Hi We Kö Now, cf. 𝔊 𝔖) for <span dir=\"rtl\">עֶת־בֹּא</span> <a data-ref=\"Haggai 1:2\" href=\"/Haggai.1.2\">Hg 1:2</a>; also <span dir=\"rtl\">עַתָּה</span> for <span dir=\"rtl\">אַתָּה</span> <a data-ref=\"I Kings 1:20\" href=\"/I_Kings.1.20\">1 K 1:20</a>, and <span dir=\"rtl\">אַתָּה</span> for <span dir=\"rtl\">עַתָּה</span> v <a data-ref=\"I Kings 1:18\" href=\"/I_Kings.1.18\">18b</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 18:3\" href=\"/II_Samuel.18.3\">2 S 18:3</a>.","note":true}],"num":"2."}]},"rid":"BDB07438","strong_numbers":["6258"],"next_hw":"עַתַּי","prev_hw":"קָצִין","occurrences":"435","quotes":[],"GK":["6964"],"TWOT":["1650c"],"parent_lexicon_details":{"name":"BDB Dictionary","language":"heb.biblical","to_language":"eng","text_categories":[],"source":"BDB Dictionary","attribution":"F. Brown, S. Driver & C. Briggs","index_title":"BDB","version_title":"A Hebrew and English lexicon of the Old Testament, by Francis Brown. With the co-operation of S. R. Driver and Charles A. Briggs. Oxford, 1906","version_lang":"en","should_autocomplete":true}}